# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# Web3Forms access key — enquiry-form submissions are emailed to you via this.
# Web3Forms' free plan works from the browser only, so this key is public
# (NEXT_PUBLIC_). That is fine — the key can only send mail to the address it
# was created with; it can't read anything.
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com  (logged in as goldhillluxetourandtravel@gmail.com)
# 2. Create a form, Website URL: goldhillluxetourandtravel.in (or localhost for testing)
# 3. Copy the Access Key and paste it below
# 4. Submit the site's form once and confirm the first email (check spam)
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
